      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，这次轮到米浴了。\n米浴想画出能把梦想传达给大家的那种绘本——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b685c6710f436846dba20bcf0e30135bbe722ee6787f55a6df310fa235e90d8",
